    "body": "For line 340 - I think this will confuse users as it looks like if they update starship and then startup nushell things will be fine, but if the newer starship has a newer init.nu, the config won't see it until it's restarted.\r\n\r\nMaybe best to drop line 340 and just have users do the `source ~/.cache/starship/init.nu` in the config, letting them know they need to manually update after updating starship?",
